# Tabs — 14px font

Every tab label in the app uses **14px** (`text-[14px]`). Do not mix 12px or
13px on tab chrome.

## Applies to

- Top bar section / sub tabs (`TopBar` — already `text-[14px]`)
- Page-level tab bars (Site Health, Prompt Tracking, AI Search Performance)
- Segmented controls that switch views (Domain/Page, URL/Domain, Visibility /
  Mentions / Citations, 7D / 28D / 3M, Leaderboard views, Chats/Dashboards)
- Drawer / modal tab strips (Notifications, Connect fixes, finding detail tabs)
- `HLTabs` / `HLTabPane` (all sizes use `14px`)
- Vertical side tabs (`VerticalTabs` — already `text-[14px]`)

## Canonical class

```jsx
className={`… text-[14px] font-medium … ${active ? '…' : '…'}`}
```

## Do not

- Do not use `text-[12px]` or `text-[13px]` on tab labels.
- Count badges *inside* tabs may stay `text-[12px]` (the badge, not the label).
